      <h1>Find a DQ Location Near You</h1>
<p>With over <strong>4,400 locations in the United States</strong> and 7,700+ worldwide, there's almost always a Dairy Queen nearby. Use the official DQ store locator to find your nearest location, check hours, and see which menu options are available.</p>
