    <h2>Find a DQ on the Official Website</h2>
    <p>The most accurate and up-to-date store locator is on the official Dairy Queen website: <a href="https://www.dairyqueen.com/en-us/locator/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">dairyqueen.com/en-us/locator/</a></p>
    <p>You can also use the DQ App (iOS and Android) to find nearby locations and order ahead.</p>
    <h2>DQ Grill &amp; Chill vs. DQ Treat Locations</h2>
    <p><strong>DQ Grill &amp; Chill</strong> locations offer the full menu — burgers, chicken baskets, breakfast (at select times), drinks, and all treats. <strong>DQ Treat</strong> locations (often in malls or food courts) focus on Blizzards, cones, sundaes, cakes, and frozen treats. They typically do not serve food items like burgers and chicken baskets.</p>
    <h2>DQ Locations by State</h2>
    <p>Dairy Queen has the highest concentration in Texas (600+ locations), followed by Minnesota (where DQ is headquartered), Ohio, Illinois, and Missouri. Texas DQ locations are especially beloved for their food menu, which in some regions includes regional items not found elsewhere.</p>
    <h2>International DQ Locations</h2>
    <p>Beyond the U.S., Dairy Queen operates in Canada, China, Saudi Arabia, UAE, Thailand, Korea, and over 20 other countries. International menus may vary significantly from U.S. offerings.</p>
